  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 tan
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Page open, checking sign-in
  s1: Signed out, reading browser list
  s2: Signed in, tracker loading
  s3: Signed out, browser list shown
  s4: Offer: move browser jobs?
  s5: Moving browser jobs
  s6: Signed in, tracker shown
  s7: Signed out, page shows fewer jobs than the browser has
  s8: Signed out, browser job lost
  s9: Moving... stuck
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the sign-in check says signed out
  s0 --> s2: the sign-in check says signed in
  s1 --> s3: the page reads the browser list
  s0 --> s3: the sign-in check says signed out
  s2 --> s1: you sign out
  s2 --> s4: the tracker list arrives
  s4 --> s1: you sign out
  s4 --> s5: you tap Move them
  s2 --> s6: the save is confirmed
  s3 --> s7: the tracker list arrives
  s5 --> s1: you sign out
  s5 --> s6: the move finishes
  s5 --> s4: the move fails
  s5 --> s5: you save a job
  s6 --> s1: you sign out
  s7 --> s8: you save a job in the browser
  s5 --> s9: the move finishes or the move fails
  s9 --> s1: you sign out
